{"steam_appid":4064510,"steam_name":"MOLE","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064510/1065297982/3d24dd0ac8379467d6a1e4e1ccda47bb6fe3bc34/1781534426/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781535057","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257359521/cd10fe45b2eb0654de559593ab956b42b6d209e3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781535057","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/e3937ca5dd50ed56661c13d7ab28b4ed82ed3478/ss_e3937ca5dd50ed56661c13d7ab28b4ed82ed3478.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786543749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/551b937bfb919de383d2017db85490235e036dea/ss_551b937bfb919de383d2017db85490235e036dea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786543749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/ad14c228ff38d06d705fb059ff438e671b4ba826/ss_ad14c228ff38d06d705fb059ff438e671b4ba826.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786543749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/fd9b82006de6d097d15384e301bdc93d01164d42/ss_fd9b82006de6d097d15384e301bdc93d01164d42.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786543749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/8aa38de0587b5db5250ada22e1b674cb71027777/ss_8aa38de0587b5db5250ada22e1b674cb71027777.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786543749"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOLE is a psychological horror experience with tactile simulation elements about madness, faith, and the depths we choose to dig. You are the Navigator aboard a deep-bore vessel, a colossal drilling machine. But the crew is gone. The vessel is silent. And the Signal won’t stop calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiral into your own history as fragments of your memory surface with choices that refuse to stay buried. Interact with the vessel's complex systems, solve diegetic puzzles, and unravel the mystery behind your missing crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla